OL,3,ARussell Brand was a 'sexual predator',
OL,4,Asays prosecution as rape trial begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FRiel Karmy-Jones KC, for the
OL,7,Fprosecution, told Southwark Crown Court
OL,8,Fin London the women "did not know each
OL,9,Fother", "have never met each other" and
OL,10,F"came forward independently of each
OL,11,Fother".
